  "cited_article_id": "search-update-pharmacy-directory",
  "reply": "Open the patient’s chart (Patients > Chart > Demographics) and go to the Pharmacy tab. Click **Search Directory** and look up the new branch by name, NPI or zip code. When the correct facility appears, select it and choose **Set as Preferred**. If the location isn’t in the national database, click **Add Custom Pharmacy**, fill in Name, Address, Phone and Fax, then click **Save Entry**. If the custom pharmacy doesn’t show up when prescribing, refresh the browser cache (Ctrl+F5 or Cmd+Shift+R) and confirm all required address fields were entered."
}
